    "title": "Make Money & Earn Cash Rewards",
    "description": "MAKE MONEY & EARN GIFT CARDS for enabling the S\u2019more lock screen. GET PAID to play games, watch videos, and more. The S\u2019more earn app allows you to earn real cash rewards in gift cards for using your phone. EARN FREE GIFT CARDS in minutes. MAKE MONEY shopping, playing games, charging, and watching videos. EARN REWARDS from your phone and make everyday a payday with the S\u2019more App! \r\n\r\nS'more earn app helps you earn money by playing games, and unlocking your phone. Everyone can earn more cash money rewards with S\u2019more. \r\n\r\nLooking for the perfect side hustle? Check out S\u2019more, the top cash money app. S\u2019more makes it easy to earn money, get paid in gift cards, and earn real cash. Get paid to watch videos, play your favorite games, take surveys, and more! \r\n\r\nMake money daily on your phone taking surveys and playing games on the S\u2019more app. \r\n\r\nHow can you make more money by using S\u2019more? \r\nMake money by enabling the S\u2019more lock screen to make money daily!\r\nGet paid cash to complete surveys on the S\u2019more earn app. \r\nEarn cash money rewards by playing free games.\r\nEarn extra cash from watching short videos! \r\nEarn gift cards, money, and cash by inviting friends to the S\u2019more Rewards App.\r\nEasily make money for having the S\u2019more earn app lock screen enabled on your phone. \r\n\r\nEarn cash for charging your phone with S\u2019more charge screen rewards. Yes we make earning cash, money, and gift cards that easy!\r\n\r\n\r\nThe S\u2019more rewards app is here! The top lock screen rewards app that pays you cash just for unlocking your phone. The S\u2019more earn app is a subscription free, lock screen rewards app that provides you with tons of ways to make money!\r\n\r\nEarn cash rewards for playing games on your way to work, charging your phone, and using your lock screen. Earn extra cash for giving us your opinion through S\u2019more rewards surveys. \r\n\r\nGet rewards! Earn over $600 per year!\r\nDon\u2019t pay money, get paid using the S\u2019more app. \r\nFree rewards and endless ways to earn money can be found in the Earn section of S\u2019more earn app. \r\nLoad up on rewards and redeem them for gift cards to your favorite retailers!\r\nMake more money for inviting friends! This fast cash rewards app helps you earn even more money when you watch videos. \r\n\r\nOnce you earn enough money to cash out in the S\u2019more Rewards App, select money rewards, cash out, and we\u2019ll send an email! \r\nS\u2019more is the app that pays you. We believe S\u2019more is the best way to get paid for doing something you already do, unlocking your phone. Why use your phone for free when you can earn gift cards, which are just as good as cash! S\u2019more is the easiest way to make money just using your phone so if you\u2019re looking for a way to earn some extra cash for free, look no further.\r\nWhen will I be able to redeem points for gift cards?\r\nFor your first redemption, you'll need to wait 10 days after installing, but after that you'll be able to redeem anytime you have enough points for a reward.\r\nWhat Gift Cards are Available?\r\nS\u2019more rewards points can be redeemed for tons of different gift cards.\r\n\u2022 Amazon Gift Cards\r\n\u2022 AMC Theaters Gift Cards\r\n\u2022 Applebee\u2019s Gift Cards\r\n\u2022 Best Buy Gift Cards\r\n\u2022 CVS Gift Cards\r\n\u2022 Starbucks Gift Cards\r\n\u2022 Target Gift Cards\r\n\u2022 & Many More\r\nEmoji Icons are provided by EmojiOne\r\n\r\nWhat are S\u2019more points? S\u2019more points are reward cash equivalents used for gift card redemption within the S\u2019more app. 100 S\u2019more reward points equals one dollar that can be redeemed as a gift card.",
